 * V-AXION-512: THE COMPLETE TITAN (v. 20.0.0)\
 * -------------------------------------------\
 * TOTAL CONSOLIDATION:\
 * 1. X86_64: AVX-512, AMX-Tiling, JIT, MSR-Safe PMU, NUMA-mbind, Siglongjmp.\
 * 2. AARCH64: NEON SIMD (Vectorized Load/Store/Not).\
 * 3. UNIVERSAL: Core-affinity, Huge Pages, Rayon-parallelism, Safe Fallbacks.\
